      "writtenOn": "2018-10-10T19:38:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we *have* to stick all of these endpoints in here? It\u0027s kind of an unfortunate shortsightedness that we glombed a bunch of stuff under /v3/users, but they\u0027re really separate APIs and creating a massive module to hold all of them is :(",
      "revId": "eda68fe8418413e8a24bffaaa13513c0edad2884",
